<xml version="Mixly 2.0 rc4" board="Arduino ESP32@ESP32 Dev Module"><comment id="!o:X#b~NhM{2s#:QxcJ_" x="-38" y="-68" h="59.14495849609375" w="289.2235107421875">发现缺少自定义模块的，去管理扩展 → mixly下载 “通用MQTT” 扩展再打开即可</comment><comment id="+PG^x}$*S/ZW[|[gWcRO" x="103" y="434" h="103.6241455078125" w="634.4000244140625">因为mixly（2.0）对除自身物联网平台以及巴法云以外的MQTT适配极差，要保持连接需要时不时执行延时函数连接客户端

注：本实例同时适配SIoT V2平台连接</comment><block type="base_setup" id="-.87/NlqkWYDmdVX=7|!" x="-295" y="68"><comment pinned="true" h="80" w="160">按照可视化面板中的相关配置填写，客户端ID不需要填写</comment><statement name="DO"><block type="variables_declare" id="pAeN+O`InWYd?HTXB1W~"><field name="variables_type">global_variate</field><field name="VAR">item</field><field name="TYPE">int</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="^Iwg[7zo0USz^~j}=#9D"><field name="NUM">0</field></block></value><next><block type="WIFI_info" id="M$sm1UqjEZPV:~fHDTeH"><value name="SSID"><shadow type="text" id="Y|q.}m=S-wh!eg6FEt93"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value><value name="PWD"><shadow type="text" id="XPKvR5:=o=)IsGVR,S5~"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value><next><block type="MQTT_subscribe_plus" id="mJv8:PN7Nf)d=IA5P|vt"><value name="server"><shadow type="text" id="MRfj^X/!Ix`~zKAb{uG5"><field name="TEXT">192.168.137.1</field></shadow></value><value name="port"><shadow type="text" id="MCQQ?[E3s+.UsKuR:Cn*"><field name="TEXT">1883</field></shadow></value><value name="client_id"><shadow type="text" id="u0[gSJ])Y/BL4kI.tkH2"><field name="TEXT"></field></shadow></value><value name="mqtt_username"><shadow type="text" id="I?Z*b+ZL#}|Zj(_Cr!;8"><field name="TEXT">siot</field></shadow></value><value name="mqtt_password"><shadow type="text" id="9wV4jyA*q8q78GTS=qy="><field name="TEXT">dfrobot</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="oSv`_D{3,4=caDuI!jV("><field name="VAR">item</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="iqEyFl^7h(/ElVX~j?;A"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="W{c5{fb@^BqQG~qtEzVS"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow><block type="variables_get" id="u/VKK`^rG/mlZkZ;anpy"><field name="VAR">item</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="pW+cW9e@ztgo.W@1aBg`"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="inout_digital_write2" id="xd/eLuD+2y7Y72